# VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY: Google Gemini API key.
# WARNING: With Vite, any VITE_-prefixed var is inlined into the client bundle at build time.
# Anyone who visits the deployed site can read this key from DevTools. Only use a key
# with tight quotas, or leave this blank and let users paste their own key via the UI.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=""

# VITE_MEM0_MCP_URL: Optional. HTTP endpoint of a Mem0 MCP server, used when the user
# switches Mem0 into "Real MCP Server" mode from the UI. Also visible in the client bundle.
# Leave blank to use browser-local mock storage only.
VITE_MEM0_MCP_URL=""
